<header class="world-header"><a class="brand" href="./"><span class="brand-sun">☀</span><span><small>EL’S INVITATION · ANIMATION STUDY</small><strong>One cedar, layered branches</strong></span></a><a href="ambient-study.php#cedar-rig">Ambient studies →</a></header>
<main><span class="eyebrow">ONE TREE · FIXED DRAWING · MOVING BRANCH LAYERS</span><h1>A small breeze through one cedar</h1>
<p class="notes">A new cutout tree based on the grove’s illustration. Its trunk stays fixed while three overlapping foliage tiers rotate as solid pieces around their attachments. Every frame reuses the same artwork. This is a standalone motion study; it has not replaced a tree on the map.</p>
<div class="controls"><button id="rigPlay" aria-pressed="false">Play breeze</button><button id="rigStill" aria-pressed="false">Compare still pose</button><label>Motion <input id="rigAmount" type="range" min="0" max="1.5" step=".1" value="1"><output id="rigAmountValue">100%</output></label></div>
<p id="rigStatus" role="status">Loading tree layers…</p>
<div class="views"><figure class="view"><figcaption>Enlarged · inspect the drawing</figcaption><canvas id="rigLarge" width="512" height="512" aria-label="Enlarged cedar animated using rigid foliage pieces"></canvas></figure><figure class="view"><figcaption>Small · approximately map scale</figcaption><canvas id="rigSmall" width="512" height="512" aria-label="The same cedar motion at a small game-like scale"></canvas></figure></div>
<h2>Inspect individual frames</h2><p class="notes">Scrubbing pauses playback. The exported sequence uses the default motion strength and the same transforms as this preview.</p>
<div class="timeline"><label for="rigFrame">Frame</label><input id="rigFrame" type="range" min="0" max="119" step="1" value="0"><output id="rigFrameValue">1 / 120</output></div>
<h2>The four reusable pieces</h2><div class="parts" id="rigParts"></div>
<p class="downloads"><a href="assets/cedar-rig-v1/frames.zip">120 PNG frames</a><a href="assets/cedar-rig-v1/contact-sheet.webp">Key-frame contact sheet</a><a href="assets/cedar-rig-v1/manifest.json">Layer and motion settings</a><a href="assets/cedar-rig-v1/prompt.txt">Art preparation prompt</a></p>
